标准\n细节锐化：动态调整各频段清晰度，确保毛发/纤维等微观结构可见\n噪点抑制：多帧降噪技术消除彩色/亮度噪点，保持肤色自然过渡\n动态补偿：修正运动模糊区域，恢复瞬时动作的清晰轮廓\n\n【处理原则】\n风格锁定：通过风格迁移算法保持原始艺术特征（如绘画笔触/摄影色调）\n元素保全：严格保护主体内容不变形，仅对缺陷区域进行局部重构\n语义连贯：确保修复区域与整体画面在光影/色彩/透视上保持统一", 1221500946, "randomize", "auto", "4k", false, "Third-party"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 16, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "shape": 7, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}, {"widget": {"name": "channel"}, "shape": 7, "name": "channel", "label": "channel", "type"